WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.460
Kimiaru ep.3

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:27.170
Calm down, Beniko. Try to count prime numbers.

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:28.670
Huh, prime numbers?

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:31.670
2, 3, 5, continue from there.

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:34.240
7, 11, 13...

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.510
17, 19, 21...

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:39.050
21 isn't a prime number, you know!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:40.590
Huh? It isn't?

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:43.350
You can divide 21 by 3 and 7!

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:44.520
Oh, that's right.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.810
You're pretty good.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.560
I'm having second thoughts about you.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.820
Hey, how long are you going to stare at me?

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.980
Wow, this must be an expensive car.

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:41.350
This is the car used for everyday transportation.

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:43.120
Don't be so nervous.

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.010
I'm not nervous, you know!

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:47.010
Yes, that's the spirit.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:52.150
Even if it's provisional, if you're going to personally serve Shinra-sama, you must get used to the best in everything.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:59.780
Reckless driver!

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.900
I'll show him the formula for victory!

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.440
You're a meddlesome servant!

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:42.360
That is what you call an elegant overtake.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:59.300
We still have time. Take this opportunity to watch her special duties.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:05.170
Wow, so Shinra-sama conducts concerts in such huge halls?

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:14.520
Knowing Shinra-sama, I bet she teases the members of the orchestra during practice.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:51.190
That should be enough for today.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:55.010
Everyone is to review their assignments so you can perform to perfection.

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:57.010
Yes, thank you very much!

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:00.340
I changed the way I played this part. How was it?

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:02.770
I was thinking of moving nearby.

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:06.700
Um, I'm not on good terms with my boyfriend these days.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:10.150
The way you played it is fine. Have confidence in yourself.

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:13.250
I have connections with realtors, so give me some time.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:17.710
Is your boyfriend the guy with the Oedipus complex who's always on your back? Break up with him!

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:23.500
The Shinra-sama at work is amazing.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.090
She's even more special during the actual performance.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.720
Colonel, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:30.210
Oh, so you're here too, Ren.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.600
Nice work!

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:33.200
Thanks.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.230
I've had enough. Here.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.230
Huh?

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:44.490
Colonel, is the real estate agent in front of the station your igo partner?

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:47.670
Yes, and as a matter of fact, I'm stronger than him.

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:52.280
There's somebody who wants to move in nearby. Make arrangements so that he can get a good deal.

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:53.730
Very well.

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:56.580
B-By the way, I'm getting thirsty.

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:04.480
You drank it.

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:07.880
Y-You were watching me?

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:10.940
U-Um... it was just... that is...

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:13.140
What is it? Tell me.

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:16.490
I-I was thirsty, so...

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:18.140
Tell me the truth.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.230
Well, that is...

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:21.150
Say it.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:25.150
It was like an indirect kiss, which made me kind of happy.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.860
I can't hear you. Say it out loud.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:32.370
It was like an indirect kiss which made me happy!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:37.000
I didn't think you'd really tell me the truth.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.580
U-Um...

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.350
Ren, you're a funny one.

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:43.780
I'm going to continue teasing you.

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:48.050
Welcome home, Shinra-sama!

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.030
Ren-chan?

00:06:57.030 --> 00:06:58.600
What's the matter?

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:01.180
Huh? Oh, Hato-nee.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.410
That sound is...

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:08.440
Ren-chan...

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:13.660
Come in.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.330
Excuse me...

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.750
Excuse me!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:23.750
It's okay. Also, you don't need to knock when I summon you.

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.020
Aren't you lucky to respond so quickly?

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:27.460
Yes...

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:31.130
Good, an honest answer.

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:33.640
This is your reward. Come.

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:54.530
You're better at this than Beni.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:56.920
Huh? T-Thank you very much.

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:05.080
Ren, what were you thinking of?

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.010
I'm sorry.

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:08.490
Why do you have to apologize?

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:11.590
T-That's because... um...

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:15.510
Ren, I need to do something at once. Help me out.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:17.490
Yes!

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:19.280
Excuse me.

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:22.640
Just as I thought. He's worth every bit of the teasing.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:28.980
Ren-chan, are you all right?

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:36.200
Didn't I tell you that Nee-san has a habit of teasing things she likes?

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:37.600
Yes.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.060
If you can't take it, just say so.

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:45.870
That is, if you want to become my personal butler.

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:58.730
And I thought I was immune to older women.

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:00.510
What's the matter, Ren-kun?

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:02.590
Natose-san.

00:09:02.590 --> 00:09:04.560
Tell Onee-chan about it.

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:06.100
Just kidding.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.570
Y-You just came out of the bath, didn't you?

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.860
I'm going to cool my head.

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:19.160
Hey, Ren-kun, you can't go now...

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.710
Not you again...

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.290
Take it easy, Beniko.

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:34.770
Think of it this way.

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:36.420
It's okay for you to be seen by me.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.130
Of course it's not!

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:49.310
Ah, it's such a mellow day.

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:52.320
Shinra-sama, may I come in?

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:58.000
Please take your time.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.280
What do you mean by "take your time"?!

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:02.080
Help me, Ren!

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.830
Sorry, Miyu-san.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:06.200
But, I now personally serve Shinra-sama.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:09.580
No, no, you beast!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.300
My soul was infringed.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:23.300
Miyu-san!

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:25.360
Nee-san forced me to...

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.520
Forced me to...

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:29.320
Miyu-san...

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:34.470
Ah, the essence from a sister is second to none.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.530
You better concede, and accept my endearment for eternity.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:44.490
No way!

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:47.660
I'll show you that you can't do as you please, Nee-san!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.620
With the Kuonji Flag!

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.040
Oh?

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:55.180
Kuonji Flag?

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:12.310
It's been a while since the last festival. I can't wait.

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:17.020
Since ancient times, flags have served an important purpose.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:21.320
Consolidated in one game known as the Kuonji Flag.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:25.830
The Kuonji Flag is a traditional ritual passed down within the Kuonji family for generations.

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:29.540
It was originally conceived to evaluate teamwork between master and servant.

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:31.290
The rules are simple.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:37.000
Seize the opponent's flag and  bring to your own territory, where you'll be declared the winner.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:40.300
Whereas, the team which has its flag taken is the loser.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:42.800
However, it's not just a game.

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:47.240
The winning team can do whatever they want with the losing team.

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:48.760
That is, according to folklore.

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:51.140
I can't lose, no matter what.

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:56.230
I'm going to win and make Nee-san become my maid for a day!

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:58.940
If I win, Miyu will...

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:12.870
The rule calls for all teams to participate, but...

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:16.290
This time, Yume won't have much to do with it.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:19.700
I will be the referee and observe the outcome of the match.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:23.840
Remember that this is just a game.

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:30.060
The Kuonji Flag game is now in session. Ready, go!

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:34.140
Our troops are to only seize and advance.

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:36.190
We are to take the offensive!

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:37.190
Roger!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.610
All troops, attack!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:45.430
Miyu-chan, what are we going to do?

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:49.030
First of all, De Niro, switch to battle mode!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.770
I'm going to kick ass!

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:04.920
We should save our strength for the subsequent cleaning duties.

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:10.220
But in case Yume defeats both Shin Onee-chan and Miyu Onee-chan...

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:14.230
You're such a good girl, Yume-kou!

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:18.230
For an intelligent person like me to be wrapped around your finger...

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:19.690
Shucks.

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:23.520
Call me "Your Royal Majesty"!

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:25.140
Ma'am.

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:27.820
Amazing, Yume! Your character has been established!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:31.230
Maybe I should get serious about this.

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.650
If that's what you say, Yume, then I'm all for it!

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:38.450
In that case, let's work together to make my presence felt as well!

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:40.600
I'm going after the flag.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:44.540
Then, I'll take advantage of my obscurity and go out on reconnaissance.

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:51.670
Since Yume isn't being taken serioulsy by either of them...

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:54.100
Perhaps I can come up with an upset.

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:57.320
Beni, from the right side. Ren, from the left.

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:59.090
All troops, attack!

00:13:59.090 --> 00:13:59.810
Huh?

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:04.820
N-No, even if it's Shin Onee-chan, I won't let you pass through!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.740
Even if you stop me, it's useless.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:13.450
All right, I've got the flag!

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:16.620
Yu...

00:14:17.260 --> 00:14:18.500
Give it back!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.010
How's this?

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:20.620
Give it back!

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:22.590
I can't reach it!

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.550
Yume!

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:31.680
Our objective has been accomplished. Head back to our territory, be merciless, and don't drop your guard!

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:32.600
Roger!

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:36.530
Will Team Shinra-sama seize the first flag already?

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:38.500
However, Natose is chasing them.

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:42.230
If the chief of security of the Kuonji estate gets serious, she's troublesome!

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:44.780
Shit...

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:50.940
Ren, until we reach upstairs...

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:52.810
Keep Natose at bay on your own.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:56.250
Then, you will be credited for contributing to this match.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:57.750
I understand.

00:14:58.740 --> 00:14:59.750
I'm counting on you.

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:01.890
Leave it to me.

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:03.290
Rest in peace.

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:05.130
Namo Amitabha.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:09.050
By the way, Shinra-sama...

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:09.740
Huh?

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:14.470
Although you told me to hold fort, is it okay to run away?

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:18.220
Fine, as long as you buy enough time for us.

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:19.600
Roger.

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:25.440
For Yume's sake, I'm going to pass through.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.440
Natose-san...

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:29.150
Sorry, Ren-kun.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:32.910
So fast...

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:38.660
She's so quick, I couldn't see her.

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:40.500
I'm going to retrieve the flag.

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:45.170
I'm not letting you go!

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:46.700
Ren-kun...

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:53.750
Onee-chan.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.820
O-Onee-chan, when you hit me, my stomach...

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:01.850
Are you all right?

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:04.340
Swallow my pride in order to contribute to victory.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.980
I'm the picture perfect butler.

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:09.910
I'm sorry...

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:11.930
I'm sorry.

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:19.870
Something happened to Ren-chan!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:22.200
Mihato, let's execute our plan.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:25.120
A graceful touchdown!

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:28.750
Team Shinra-sama has taken the flag!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.000
All that's left is Miyu-tan's flag.

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:33.260
We're going to deliver a frontal attack!

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:36.970
Huh?

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:41.140
So you've arrived, Shinra-sama and the other.

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:42.560
Don't say "other"!

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:45.010
I will not allow anyone to step any further.

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:46.560
Perhaps.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.060
Beni, take care of her!

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:49.480
Roger!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.240
Hato, it's a good opportunity.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:56.160
To send you a message about who's the boss.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:17:01.790
That's frightening. In order to protect myself, I may have to break one of your arms.

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:04.790
Huh? I dare you!

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:10.840
Huh? She's retreating too easily. Don't go after her, Beni!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.750
Hold it, you...

00:17:13.770 --> 00:17:20.180
While Mihato creates a diversion, the assault troop is probably going after our flag.

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:24.010
But, Ren is protecting our goal.

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:26.800
Although he may still feel damage from Natose's attack...

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:29.900
Holding back the runt ought to be child's play.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:32.920
However, Miyu-tan surely must be thinking of the same thing.

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:36.220
That smart aleck moe character... what is she up to?

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:40.390
Nee-san is overlooking an important point.

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:43.910
You don't just win this game by taking the opponent's flag.

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:46.910
At last, it's my cue!

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.020
The field for this game is limited to the Kuonji estate.

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:54.720
There's no further room for you to escape!

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:58.250
My, my, so you followed me all the way, just as I planned.

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:02.260
Onee-chan's secret tool: Rope!

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:09.310
Kuruppo!

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:12.310
Huh? Do you think you can beat me with a toy like that...

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.760
Don't underestimate a chef!

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:16.890
I'm going to pluck you all!

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:20.320
Hey... what?

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:23.770
Where are you touching? No!

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:26.660
My, my, yours is bigger than I thought.

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:29.330
H-Humiliating...

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:33.920
Beni!

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.250
Shinra-sama, run away!

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:39.420
Allow me to capture you.

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:44.850
Not so fast!

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:47.470
Ren.

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:47.470
Ren-chan.

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:51.100
Our troops are to take the offensive, correct?

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.640
Good. Go for it, Ren!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.900
Ren-chan, you're so cool!

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:01.280
Team Shinra-sama's victory is just around the corner.

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:05.000
All that's left is to raise the flag within their goal.

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:08.000
Damn, the imitation egg!

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:13.290
Welcome to my recital.

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.850
An ultrasonic attack!

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:19.300
Listen to my song!

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:23.290
♪ I'm  Miyu's De Niro ♪ 

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.510
Everything is according to plan.

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:27.570
M-Miyu-san?

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:32.860
I'm going to take both Yume and Nee-san's flag at the same time.

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:35.110
But before that, return my flag.

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:37.690
Even if it's Miyu-san's orders, I won't listen.

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:41.000
Really? Then, how about this?

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:42.700
Flash.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.490
S-Service shots for the win...

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:49.320
Sulk...

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:53.040
Was my tactic too adult for you?

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:55.520
So, we're going to win...

00:19:57.040 --> 00:20:00.050
What? What's going on?

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:01.980
Heavy, isn't it?

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:04.830
Let go of the flag!

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:11.020
Whatever subterfuge Miyu comes up with, it won't matter.

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:13.820
Since Ren is a poor loser.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:17.590
What Miyu owns is Miyu's.

00:20:17.590 --> 00:20:20.070
And what you own is Miyu's.

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:23.240
This is Shinra-sama's.

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:26.610
You... stay back!

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:28.660
Chuuken, Miyu vertical chop!

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:30.520
Translators note: Chuuken is one of Pai Chan's signature moves in Virtua Fighter.

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:32.160
Ouch! What a blockhead!

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:33.430
All right...

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.210
Touchdown!

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:39.330
Game over!

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:41.500
And the winner of the Kuonji Flag is...

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:44.240
Team Shinra-sama!

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:50.420
Yume Ojou-sama, who tried to protect her flag on her own.

00:20:50.420 --> 00:20:53.740
Miyu-sama, who tried to take the flag by herself.

00:20:53.740 --> 00:20:56.680
And Shinra-sama, who used other people effectively.

00:20:56.680 --> 00:21:00.070
The difference reflected upon the final outcome.

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:04.470
Tomorrow I'm going to take my time with you, Miyu-tan.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:16.510
I get the feeling I forgot something.

00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:18.170
It must be my imagination.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:26.220
Nobody noticed me at all...

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:29.740
You two did a great job.

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:36.180
You should remain as my personal assistant.

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.230
Prove your loyalty to me.

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:40.000
Shinra-sama.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:43.770
Hey, you serf!

00:21:43.770 --> 00:21:44.530
Geez...

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:47.030
Don't get carried away like that!

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:51.290
A-Am I being influenced?

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:10.620
At least you can knock.

00:22:11.650 --> 00:22:14.570
My defense mechanism set in, creating a pixelation effect.

00:22:14.570 --> 00:22:16.160
Oh, well.

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:19.600
Look at my rugged back. What do you think?

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:22.190
It's huge...

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:27.530
Your countless scars are an honorable token of your brave military days.

00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:29.010
With that said, please excuse me.

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:32.790
Since you're here, might as well have you wash my back.

00:22:32.790 --> 00:22:35.730
Let's talk about manhood.

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:37.870
My interests don't include sharing a bath with some geezer...

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:40.280
Come on, at least you can take your clothes off.

00:22:40.280 --> 00:22:41.830
Whoa, that's pretty impressive.

00:22:40.600 --> 00:22:41.830
H-H-Hey, hold on!

00:22:41.830 --> 00:22:43.470
It's my pleasure!

00:24:11.420 --> 00:24:12.660
Morning, Miyu-tan.

00:24:13.400 --> 00:24:16.010
Ah, you're so cute in every which way, Miyu-tan!

00:24:17.140 --> 00:24:20.310
To be dragged into bed the second the clock struck midnight...

00:24:20.760 --> 00:24:22.430
What shall I do next.

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:24.350
That's right, let's go to the sea.
